soh/CMakeLists.txt: iOS platform branch — MACOSX_BUNDLE app target with
Info.plist template (new file soh/ios/Info.plist.in), main=SDL_main on
src/code/main.c (SDL2main UIKit shim owns the real main), OBJCXX/ARC and
Darwin warning flags extended to iOS, espeak skipped, deps: SDL2-static
from LUS FetchContent + prebuilt static ogg/vorbis/opus/opusfile via
-DSOH_IOS_DEPS_PREFIX, soh.o2r bundled via -DSOH_O2R_PATH, SDL2_net
omitted on iOS.

